- Brokerage fee: $5\%$ of $400{,}000 = 0.05 \times 400{,}000 = 20{,}000$
- Remaining loan amount: $250{,}000$

Total deductions = $12{,}000 + 20{,}000 + 250{,}000 = 282{,}000$

Net proceeds = Selling price − Total deductions = $400{,}000 − 282{,}000 = 118{,}000$

Net proceeds from selling the house: $\boxed{118000}$
